## Code Example
```javascript
// simple scoring skeleton
function score(pcaScores, loadings, threshold){
  const alerts = [];
  for(const i in pcaScores){
    if(Math.abs(pcaScores[i])>threshold) alerts.push(i);
  }
  return alerts;
}
```

